    "message": "Security update available. This version is superseded by AsiBackbone 5.0.0, which addresses published security findings affecting versions through 4.0.0. Upgrade all consumed AsiBackbone.* packages together to 5.0.0. Review the 4.0.0 → 5.0.0 migration guide before deployment, especially if your host persists AsiBackbone enum values as integers, as a data migration may be required. See the repository security advisories and migration documentation for details.",
